'''Chroma Icecream''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[Summer Box '26|2026 Summer box]] during the [[Summer Event 2026|2026 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
Chroma Icecream appears as its counterpart, icecream, with a long cone handle and a tall swirl of icecream as the blade. The icecream changes color, but can be a solid rainbow when Chroma Toggled. 

== Trivia ==
* It is the chroma counterpart of the godly knife [[Icecream]], which is obtainable from the same box.
